[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3358554945","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111119#issuecomment-3358554945","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111119","id":3358554945,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IL3tB","user":{"login":"PhairZ","id":123702514,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1-M8g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123702514?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ","html_url":"https://github.com/PhairZ","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-01T23:58:38Z","updated_at":"2025-10-01T23:58:38Z","body":"The window behavior seems to work fine but `window_get_mode()` does get the mode wrong.\nTested in Godot v4.6.dev (d705613db) - Arch Linux on Wayland.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3358554945/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3358601189","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111119#issuecomment-3358601189","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111119","id":3358601189,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IMC_l","user":{"login":"PhairZ","id":123702514,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1-M8g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123702514?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ","html_url":"https://github.com/PhairZ","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T00:24:39Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T00:24:39Z","body":"After some testing I found that adding a really small delay (setting a timer with 0.001s or an empty for loop with ~800000 iterations) between setting and getting window modes fixes the issue and test passes. Tried disabling the animations but that didn't seem to change anything.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3358601189/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3358742346","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111119#issuecomment-3358742346","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111119","id":3358742346,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IMldK","user":{"login":"timothyqiu","id":372476,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3MjQ3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/372476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu","html_url":"https://github.com/timothyqiu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timothyqiu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T02:05:34Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T02:05:34Z","body":"It's very likely due to X11 being client-server. The client can only send a minimization request to the X server. Whether and when the window minimizes is controlled by the X server. Therefore, a time lag is inevitable between modifying the mode and the actual change.\n\nThe best we can do is probably to make `window_set_mode()` block until the state actually changes or timeout.\n\nSee also #110990.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3358742346/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3358840653","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111119#issuecomment-3358840653","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111119","id":3358840653,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7IM9dN","user":{"login":"PhairZ","id":123702514,"node_id":"U_kgDOB1-M8g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/123702514?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ","html_url":"https://github.com/PhairZ","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhairZ/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-02T02:56:21Z","updated_at":"2025-10-02T02:58:45Z","body":"after a lot of playing around I realized I was running X11/XWayland. Now that I,m on Wayland indeed the window does not unminimize unlike in x11 mode where it did unminimize. XDG doesn't provide a protocol for unsetting minimize apparently.\n\nThis is the output for Wayland:\nWINDOW_MODE_WINDOWED curent mode: 0 should be 0\nWINDOW_MODE_MINIMIZED curent mode: 1 should be 1\nWINDOW_MODE_WINDOWED curent mode: 0 should be 0\nWINDOW_MODE_MAXIMIZED curent mode: 0 should be 2\nWINDOW_MODE_FULLSCREEN curent mode: 0 should be 3\nWINDOW_MODE_MINIMIZED curent mode: 1 should be 1\n\nIt appears to me that whoever wrote the `WaylandThread::window_try_set_mode()` method forgot to set window mode for modes other than minimized, that or somewhere else this was supposed to be handled but it wasn't. The latter might be the case, because the author set minimized manually due to the fact that we cannot detect minimized windows in XDG. This is a whole and entirely separate issue though.\n\nEDIT: This is also fixed by adding a subtle delay between setting and getting modes.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3358840653/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]